{
  "id": 1309,
  "name": "serious-mint",
  "fling_power": 10,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "nature-mints",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/50/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　かおりを　かがせると\nこうげき　ぼうぎょ　すばやさ　とくぼう\nとくこうが　まんべんなく　そだつ　ミント。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "포켓몬에게 향기를 맡게 하면\n공격, 방어, 스피드, 특수방어\n특수공격이 골고루 오르게 되는 민트.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "讓寶可夢聞這種薄荷的氣味，\n會令攻擊、防禦、速度、\n特防和特攻均衡地成長。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si un Pokémon hume cet aromate, son Attaque,\nsa Défense, sa Vitesse, son Attaque Spéciale\net sa Défense Spéciale se développeront uniformément.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lässt man ein Pokémon an dieser Minze schnuppern,\nsteigen Angriff, Verteidigung, Spezial-Angriff,\nSpezial-Verteidigung und Initiative gleichmäßig.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cuando un Pokémon percibe su aroma, su Ataque,\nDefensa, Velocidad, Defensa Especial y Ataque Especial\ncrecen de forma uniforme.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Quando un Pokémon ne sente il profumo, le sue\nstatistiche di Attacco, Difesa, Velocità, Difesa Speciale\ne Attacco Speciale aumentano uniformemente.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "When a Pokémon smells this mint, all of its stats will\ngrow at an equal rate.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　香りを　かがせると\n攻撃　防御　素早さ　特防\n特攻が　万遍なく　育つ　ミント。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "宝可梦闻了这种薄荷之后，\n攻击、防御、速度、\n特防、特攻能全方位提高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cuando un Pokémon percibe su aroma, su Ataque,\nDefensa, Velocidad, Defensa Especial y Ataque Especial\ncrecen de forma uniforme.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
